# AI Gateway model used by the Import Content Plan and Generate with AI
# features (app/api/import-plan/route.ts). Optional — defaults to a free-tier
# model (inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-fin) if unset, so the app works with no
# AI Gateway credits purchased.
#
# To use a different model (e.g. after adding paid credits, or to bring your
# own key), set this to any Vercel AI Gateway model slug and redeploy — no
# code change needed. Browse available models, including which ones are free:
# https://vercel.com/ai-gateway/models?freeTier=true
# AI_GATEWAY_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.4-mini
